{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WKA2n9CEUunCKN6p1pTwsR","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-14-1200-bulk-alloc-mle-fold-buffers\n2\t\n3\tReplace per-matrix GPU buffer allocation in MLE sumcheck fold rounds with bulk pre-allocated arena buffers. Currently, each MLE round allocates ~2000 individual DeviceBuffers for fold output matrices (one per trace matrix for both mat_evals and sels), totaling ~40K cudaMallocAsync/cudaFreeAsync calls across ~20 rounds. This per-round allocation overhead causes MLE Rounds to reverse-scale at APC 300 (173ms vs 114ms at APC 0 despite 2x less work), contributing ~59ms of pure CUDA memory API overhead on the main thread. By allocating a single contiguous buffer per fold group per round, we reduce 40K allocations to ~40, eliminating the per-matrix allocation/free overhead and improving memory pool behavior for subsequent phases.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a5282c7d-e31f-4078-851d-3bd2d8ef1f99","uuid":"f7c89664-0691-4a55-ac75-e78438696f23","timestamp":"2026-04-14T10:24:03.255Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-14-1200-bulk-alloc-mle-fold-buffers\n\nReplace per-matrix GPU buffer allocation in MLE sumcheck fold rounds with bulk pre-allocated arena buffers. Currently, each MLE round allocates ~2000 individual DeviceBuffers for fold output matrices (one per trace matrix for both mat_evals and sels), totaling ~40K cudaMallocAsync/cudaFreeAsync calls across ~20 rounds. This per-round allocation overhead causes MLE Rounds to reverse-scale at APC 300 (173ms vs 114ms at APC 0 despite 2x less work), contributing ~59ms of pure CUDA memory API overhead on the main thread. By allocating a single contiguous buffer per fold group per round, we reduce 40K allocations to ~40, eliminating the per-matrix allocation/free overhead and improving memory pool behavior for subsequent phases.\n","numLi